/*
 * Palace Fig Garden — south of outside29, east of outside31.
 *
 * Strategy A FluffOS room. Original (TimeMsg, pick fig,
 * sit/meditate/search, northwest outside30) is
 * garden1_ldmud.lpc. Look at fig grove / ripe figs /
 * hedges is flavour. Pick/sit/meditate/search are not
 * loaded. East garden2 is loaded. Archive keeps
 * “perferred”, “figs..”, and “the the ripe”.
 */

