      "As you look out from the tiny fig garden you can see the elegant lime trees "
      "border the smooth brownstone avenue gently curving to the east, west and "
      "south.\n",
    "stone":
      "The smooth brownstones are carefully cut and laid with almost seamless "
      "precision.\n",
    "stones":
      "The smooth brownstones are carefully cut and laid with almost seamless "
      "precision.\n",
    "brownstones":
      "The smooth brownstones are carefully cut and laid with almost seamless "
      "precision.\n",
    "brownstone":
      "The smooth brownstones are carefully cut and laid with almost seamless "
